        "Every lot ships with an EN 10204 3.1 mill test certificate, and heat numbers are marked on each piece so they can be traced back to it. Alloy and stainless items can be PMI-checked before dispatch, and inspection by your own or a third-party agency is welcome at our works. Steam-line items for boiler work can be supplied with IBR documents. We use the same route to serve Patna, Gaya, Muzaffarpur and Darbhanga, so mixed orders for plants in the region can be planned together."
