        "q": "Which flanges and fittings does Remax Forge supply to Surat?",
        "a": "We deliver Weld Neck Flanges, Slip On Flanges, SW Couplings and Threaded Flanges to Surat in SS 316L/317L, Duplex 2205, Alloy 20, dimensioned to ASME B16.5, B16.47 and B16.11. Demand here comes mainly from petrochemical & chemical and steel & metals — including units around Hazira industrial complex — and every lot ships with EN 10204 3.1 certification."
