        "q": "Which industrial areas in and around Surat do you deliver to?",
        "a": "We deliver door-to-site across Surat, including Hazira industrial complex, Sachin GIDC and Pandesara, and to nearby Gandhinagar, Ahmedabad, Rajkot and Vadodara. Goods leave our Mumbai stock within 24–48 hours and travel by road on NH48 direct (~280 km), normally arriving in about 1 day."
