    "faqs": [
      {
        "q": "What products can buyers in Mumbai source from Remax Forge?",
        "a": "We deliver Weld Neck Flanges, Spectacle Blind Flanges, Butt Weld Elbows and Lap Joint Flanges to Mumbai in A105, F11/F22, SS 316L, Duplex 2205, dimensioned to ASME B16.5, B16.47 and B16.11. Demand here comes mainly from oil & gas (refining) and ports & marine — including units around MIDC Andheri — and every lot ships with EN 10204 3.1 certification."
      },
      {
        "q": "Do you handle sour-service and RTJ requirements for Mumbai projects?",
        "a": "Yes. For refinery and hydrocarbon service near HQ city: HPCL & BPCL refineries we supply weld neck and RTJ-faced flanges plus spectacle blinds in A105, F11/F22, SS 316L and Duplex 2205, compliant with NACE MR0175 where specified. Third-party (3.2) inspection can be arranged on request."
      },
      {
        "q": "How long does delivery to Mumbai actually take?",
        "a": "Honestly: ex-stock items dispatch from our Mumbai warehouse within 24–48 hours and reach Mumbai in roughly 1 days by road. Custom forgings add 7–15 working days of production. We confirm a dated schedule with every quotation rather than promising blanket next-day delivery."
      },
      {
        "q": "Which industrial areas in and around Mumbai do you deliver to?",
        "a": "We deliver door-to-site across Mumbai, including MIDC Andheri, Taloja, Rabale (TTC) and port zone, and to nearby Nagpur, Nashik, Pune and Thane. Goods leave our Mumbai stock within 24–48 hours and travel by road by local road dispatch, normally arriving in about 1 day."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is your facility located in Mumbai?",
        "a": "No — and we say so plainly. Manufacturing, stock and testing are at our ISO 9001:2015 facility in Mumbai; Mumbai is served through scheduled road dispatches with full documentation. Buyers are welcome to audit the Mumbai works in person or by video inspection before ordering."
      },
      {
        "q": "Which documents do you provide with supply to Mumbai?",
        "a": "Every Mumbai dispatch includes EN 10204 3.1 mill test certificates, dimensional reports and hydro/NDT test reports as ordered, NACE MR0175 compliance and 3.2 third-party inspection on request. 100% PMI is standard on alloy and stainless lots."
      },
      {
        "q": "Do you accept small orders from Mumbai?",
        "a": "We keep MOQs low for the Mumbai corridor — small lots are clubbed with our scheduled dispatches on this route, so a single-item trial order is workable. Project-quantity rates apply from roughly 100 pieces or 500 kg per grade."
      }
    ],
