        "q": "What is the realistic delivery time to Kolkata?",
        "a": "Honestly: ex-stock items dispatch from our Mumbai warehouse within 24–48 hours and reach Kolkata in roughly 5 days by road (NH53+NH16 via Nagpur (~1,900 km)). Custom forgings add 7–15 working days of production. We confirm a dated schedule with every quotation rather than promising blanket next-day delivery."
