        "a": "We deliver door-to-site across Kolkata, including Howrah engineering cluster, Taratala and port zone, and to nearby Siliguri, Durgapur, Asansol and Kharagpur. Goods leave our Mumbai stock within 24–48 hours and travel by road on NH53+NH16 via Nagpur (~1,900 km), normally arriving in about 5 days."
